及水能飲用，看評論豆花評價不錯高，下次有機會再嚐嚐，店家願意開立發票及餐品定價都值得多多支持，但私心希望碗不要是美耐皿，隔壁臺北市已經開始實施禁用一次性塑膠袋及美耐皿了，希望這項政策能有更多店家留意及自發性參與，\n\n臺北市政府自 2016 年起分階段推動「禁用一次性及美耐皿餐具」政策。此政策並非針對全市所有商家，而是以政府機關、學校及特定營業場所為優先實施對象，旨在減少垃圾量並維護飲食安全，避免美耐皿遇熱溶出三聚氰胺。",null,[0,188]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/4694982192475151116/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBKTTAxV2FFTmhNV1JPWVRGS1dsUkhTbFJVVjFGM1QxVnNiMlJWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4694982192475151116/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBKTTAxV2FFTmhNV1JPWVRGS1dsUkhTbFJVVjFGM1QxVnNiMlJWUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/4694982192475151116/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBKTTAxV2FFTmhNV1JPWVRGS1dsUkhTbFJVVjFGM1QxVnNiMlJWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4694982192475151116/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBKTTAxV2FFTmhNV1JPWVRGS1dsUkhTbFJVVjFGM1QxVnNiMlJWUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/4694982192475151116/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBKTTAxV2FFTmhNV1JPWVRGS1dsUkhTbFJVVjFGM1QxVnNiMlJWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4694982192475151116/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBKTTAxV2FFTmhNV1JPWVRGS1dsUkhTbFJVVjFGM1QxVnNiMlJWUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,866,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pJM01WaENhMWROYTFKWlRHSlRUV1F3T1Vsb2RVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x4ba19ee6e08ef273!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjI3MVhCa1dNa1JZTGJTTWQwOUlodUE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pJM01WaENhMWROYTFKWlRHSlRUV1F3T1Vsb2RVRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pJM01WaENhMWROYTFKWlRHSlRUV1F3T1Vsb2RVRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pJM01WaENhMWROYTFKWlRHSlRUV1F3T1Vsb2RVRRILMGRwb3NHajBUTGcaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5